WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.400
Give thanks!

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.410
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.820
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:24.990
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:47.850 --> 00:01:50.290
Someone once said...

00:01:50.820 --> 00:01:56.520
There are pouches of spongy, deep-fried tofu

00:01:56.520 --> 00:02:00.460
filled with natural seaweed soup and tied 
at the top with soft, stringy konnyaku.

00:02:00.460 --> 00:02:03.800
Seaweed Sponyyaku Pouches!

00:02:04.830 --> 00:02:10.540
Inside certain pea pods are freshly-fried,

00:02:10.540 --> 00:02:12.110
sweet and soft yet crispy peas...

00:02:12.110 --> 00:02:16.210
Pea Donuts!

00:02:17.040 --> 00:02:19.480
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:19.480 --> 00:02:24.180
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:27.250 --> 00:02:29.960
Toriko and the others got 
aboard the Gourmet Carriage,

00:02:29.960 --> 00:02:32.590
which stops off at gourmet 
cities around the world.

00:02:34.760 --> 00:02:39.500
In order to obtain Mellow Cola, 
one of his "training ingredients",

00:02:39.500 --> 00:02:41.870
Toriko set off for the Gourmet Pyramid.

00:02:44.040 --> 00:02:48.010
But Toriko and Komatsu need Zebra's help,

00:02:48.010 --> 00:02:51.840
so they head off first for the Gourmet 
prison known as Honey Prison.

00:02:54.050 --> 00:02:55.850
Hurry up and get here...

00:02:56.420 --> 00:02:57.720
Toriko...

00:03:00.490 --> 00:03:04.560
Finally, He Appears! The Last 
of the Four Kings, Zebra!

00:03:14.470 --> 00:03:18.470
<i>This</i> should be enough, right, Zebra?

00:03:19.370 --> 00:03:21.370
Toriko-san, um...

00:03:21.370 --> 00:03:24.340
You've been talking to 
yourself for a while now...

00:03:25.880 --> 00:03:27.610
He's my partner,

00:03:27.610 --> 00:03:29.450
a chef by the name of Komatsu.

00:03:30.420 --> 00:03:33.720
No! Komatsu's no present for you!

00:03:33.720 --> 00:03:35.120
What, did you plan on eatin' him?!

00:03:35.450 --> 00:03:40.260
Who the heck are you talking to?! 
Do you see a ghost, Toriko-san?!

00:03:40.260 --> 00:03:45.160
Certainly, I've had the chills since we 
passed through the Gate to the Underworld.

00:03:45.400 --> 00:03:47.230
This creepy atmosphere...

00:03:47.600 --> 00:03:52.070
It's like we really are heading 
for the land of the dead.

00:03:52.670 --> 00:03:54.040
I can see it, Komatsu.

00:03:54.510 --> 00:03:55.970
It is a ghost after all?!

00:03:56.570 --> 00:03:58.980
Well, there are plenty of those...

00:03:59.340 --> 00:04:02.750
That's the Gourmet prison 
called Honey Prison!

00:04:02.750 --> 00:04:06.250
It looks like a beehive... 
but it's a Gourmet prison?!

00:04:06.480 --> 00:04:10.650
It's a little more pleasant than I pictured.

00:04:10.650 --> 00:04:13.390
The name "Honey Prison" is cute, too.

00:04:13.390 --> 00:04:16.360
If only it was that kind 
of a fairy tale place.

00:04:21.330 --> 00:04:23.170
Mr. Toriko is here!

00:04:24.700 --> 00:04:26.340
We've been waiting for you,

00:04:26.700 --> 00:04:28.470
Mr. Toriko and Mr. Komatsu.

00:04:30.770 --> 00:04:35.110
I am the vice-chief of Honey Prison, Oban.

00:04:35.380 --> 00:04:39.350
The Chief has explained everything to me.

00:04:39.350 --> 00:04:43.290
This place is scary after 
all! It's not cute one bit!

00:04:43.290 --> 00:04:44.890
What?

00:04:44.890 --> 00:04:49.390
If you heard from old man Ichiryu, 
there was no need to meet us here.

00:04:49.660 --> 00:04:52.230
You know about the "seasons" around here?

00:04:52.890 --> 00:04:57.630
Because of the danger, we can't go 
outside without taking precautions.

00:04:58.470 --> 00:05:00.700
Now come. The chief is waiting.

00:05:02.700 --> 00:05:07.340
A scary-looking guy like that was 
walking down a path he calls dangerous.

00:05:07.780 --> 00:05:10.710
It must really be horrifying...

00:05:17.120 --> 00:05:20.190
And now, I will give you 
a tour of Honey Prison.

00:05:21.120 --> 00:05:24.490
Those who break the Gourmet 
laws as decided on by the IGO

00:05:24.490 --> 00:05:26.490
are committed to Gourmet prison,

00:05:26.490 --> 00:05:28.700
which are spread throughout the world,

00:05:29.100 --> 00:05:34.170
but there are only three prisons in the 
world where sentences are carried out

00:05:34.170 --> 00:05:36.700
against Class A Gourmet criminals who 
commit especially serious crimes.

00:05:37.370 --> 00:05:40.340
Those are the three Great Gourmet Prisons,

00:05:40.610 --> 00:05:44.950
built on land, at sea, and 
in the air respectively.

00:05:45.710 --> 00:05:51.650
The first floats 10,000 meters 
in the air, Sky Prison.

00:05:52.090 --> 00:05:57.560
Tornadoes form frequently and Avian 
Beasts that are kept hungry fly around.

00:05:57.560 --> 00:06:00.190
It's a prison from which 
escape is impossible.

00:06:01.290 --> 00:06:07.830
The second is submerged 2,000 meters 
below the sea, Prison Submarine.

00:06:08.130 --> 00:06:10.540
Not only is the water pressure 
400 atmospheres at this depth,

00:06:10.540 --> 00:06:13.440
but swarms of vicious 
carnivorous fish swim around.

00:06:13.440 --> 00:06:15.640
It is also impossible to escape this prison.

00:06:16.040 --> 00:06:19.140
And the last Great Gourmet 
Prison is right here.

00:06:19.650 --> 00:06:22.450
The prison on land, Honey Prison.

00:06:22.780 --> 00:06:26.890
Over 100 million prisoners 
can be accommodated here.

00:06:27.220 --> 00:06:30.320
It is indeed the world's 
biggest Gourmet prison.

00:06:30.990 --> 00:06:35.060
Every day, hundreds of vicious 
criminals are transported

00:06:35.060 --> 00:06:38.160
from the Gate to the Underworld 
up this steep path

00:06:38.160 --> 00:06:39.730
that's dozens of kilometers long.

00:06:40.570 --> 00:06:45.200
A-rank Execution Beasts are stationed 
along the way to stand watch.

00:06:46.100 --> 00:06:51.610
And there are one-kilometer long giant 
drawbridges at 12 different points.

00:06:51.910 --> 00:06:57.150
They are only let through after 
a strict Gourmet ID check.

00:06:57.650 --> 00:06:59.080
Depending on the season,

00:06:59.080 --> 00:07:02.350
even the tough Convoy Beasts are 
attacked by the Forest Ogres,

00:07:02.350 --> 00:07:05.490
sometimes fatally, so it's a dangerous path.

00:07:05.760 --> 00:07:08.030
F-Forest Ogres...?

00:07:08.230 --> 00:07:11.160
If you're lucky, you might see one.

00:07:12.100 --> 00:07:12.600
Or rather...

00:07:13.160 --> 00:07:16.570
...if you're unlucky, perhaps.

00:07:17.130 --> 00:07:18.870
Well, we've arrived.

00:07:26.680 --> 00:07:29.910
This is the front desk area of Honey Prison.

00:07:29.910 --> 00:07:33.350
Huh. There sure are all 
kinds of Execution Beasts.

00:07:34.120 --> 00:07:37.090
They're all Beasts that have 
been tamed by Chief Love.

00:07:38.450 --> 00:07:43.590
Most prisoners lose their fighting spirit 
and prepare themselves for the worst.

00:07:43.590 --> 00:07:44.990
I'll bet.

00:07:44.990 --> 00:07:49.470
A chief who can tame all these 
Beasts must really be something.

00:07:49.800 --> 00:07:51.630
I can't wait to meet him.

00:07:58.410 --> 00:08:00.980
Anything to report, Choupali?

00:08:00.980 --> 00:08:06.080
Yes, Vice-Chief. It seems that about 
20 of the prisoners have been attacked.

00:08:06.080 --> 00:08:07.420
Is he on a rampage again?

00:08:07.420 --> 00:08:09.890
Who's on a rampage?

00:08:09.890 --> 00:08:10.990
I can guess...

00:08:10.990 --> 00:08:15.660
Don't worry. He's in a better 
mood now and has calmed down.

00:08:16.290 --> 00:08:18.260
Jeez, Zebra...

00:08:18.260 --> 00:08:20.600
Zebra-san went on a rampage?

00:08:20.800 --> 00:08:22.500
It's the usual.

00:08:24.400 --> 00:08:25.770
Is the chief in the office?

00:08:25.770 --> 00:08:29.940
Yes. The chief's the one who's 
in a bad mood right now.

00:08:29.940 --> 00:08:31.340
I know.

00:08:31.570 --> 00:08:36.640
Even now, the chief is basically 
against letting Zebra out.

00:08:37.950 --> 00:08:41.350
Chief Love is really mad.

00:08:41.350 --> 00:08:44.520
Chief Love is scary, so please be careful.

00:08:47.290 --> 00:08:49.520
Your face is scary, too...

00:08:49.520 --> 00:08:52.630
But if people this scary are 
frightened by the chief,

00:08:52.630 --> 00:08:55.130
then what kind of person must he be?

00:08:55.130 --> 00:08:57.130
And Zebra-san...

00:08:59.130 --> 00:09:02.000
Toriko-san! Toriko-san!

00:09:05.910 --> 00:09:10.080
Transport Beasts, do you want the 
souvenirs I brought for Zebra?

00:09:10.080 --> 00:09:14.980
Give it up. You'd all 
just get eaten by Zebra.

00:09:15.880 --> 00:09:17.120
Menu?

00:09:17.120 --> 00:09:23.060
We have a number of Penalty Full Course 
Menus prepared for our prisoners here.

00:09:23.060 --> 00:09:24.990
Penalty Full Course?!

00:09:27.090 --> 00:09:28.890
One of them is Menu IV.

00:09:29.360 --> 00:09:31.960
It's a course prepared for prisoners

00:09:31.960 --> 00:09:35.570
who have committed the serious 
crime of public gluttony.

00:09:35.930 --> 00:09:39.040
It's called Food Seizing Full Course.

00:09:39.040 --> 00:09:40.270
Food Seizing?

00:09:40.670 --> 00:09:44.280
The greatest joy in the 
Gourmet Age is to eat.

00:09:44.680 --> 00:09:48.280
Therefore, the greatest punishment 
is to have food taken away.

00:09:48.280 --> 00:09:49.920
Or in other words, Food Seizing.

00:09:50.180 --> 00:09:53.820
Would you like to take a look? 
It's on the way, anyway.

00:09:59.090 --> 00:10:04.330
What's with this cake?! It isn't sweet 
at all! What's wrong with this food?!

00:10:04.830 --> 00:10:06.460
I know that guy!

00:10:06.460 --> 00:10:09.270
He's a first-class Gourmet 
swindler who ran out

00:10:09.270 --> 00:10:12.800
on an over two trillion-yen bill 
at a high class restaurant.

00:10:13.100 --> 00:10:16.740
He's known as "Eat-and-Run 
Norisuke", a notorious swindler.

00:10:16.740 --> 00:10:19.310
He targeted my restaurant, too!

00:10:19.310 --> 00:10:21.210
As he has a considerable sweet tooth,

00:10:21.210 --> 00:10:23.650
the appetizer of his Food Seizing Full Course

00:10:23.650 --> 00:10:27.280
has blocked his ability to taste sweetness.

00:10:27.850 --> 00:10:30.850
Please, let me eat something sweet!

00:10:30.850 --> 00:10:35.930
Suffering from not eating your favorite 
food? Only in a Gourmet prison...

00:10:38.630 --> 00:10:42.230
That is Rick, who's been 
imprisoned for the heinous crime

00:10:42.230 --> 00:10:44.970
of cultivating, illegally selling, and using

00:10:44.970 --> 00:10:46.670
the controlled substance Drug Maimai,

00:10:46.670 --> 00:10:49.110
which even a single one is 
said can destroy a country.

00:10:49.670 --> 00:10:52.240
His ability to feel 
pleasure has been blocked,

00:10:52.240 --> 00:10:56.110
so he'll suffer eternally 
from withdrawal symptoms.

00:10:58.580 --> 00:11:01.680
Next, we have a leader of 
Gourmet bandits, Bidan.

00:11:01.680 --> 00:11:04.050
He's a violent criminal who killed

00:11:04.050 --> 00:11:07.060
over 20 Gourmet Hunters and 
stole their ingredients.

00:11:05.550 --> 00:11:08.590
Just let me have one bite!

00:11:08.590 --> 00:11:12.460
Joimal is the head of a 
Gourmet poaching ring.

00:11:12.460 --> 00:11:13.960
He committed the serious crime

00:11:13.960 --> 00:11:17.900
of poaching over 160 animals of 
17 different endangered species.

00:11:17.900 --> 00:11:20.740
That's my favorite, please!

00:11:22.040 --> 00:11:26.470
Everyone's Food Seizing Full Course consists 
of taking away one's favorite food,

00:11:26.470 --> 00:11:29.410
but this is only the appetizer.

00:11:29.880 --> 00:11:31.710
The criminals with the more severe crimes

00:11:31.710 --> 00:11:34.250
proceed to the next level, the soup floor,

00:11:34.250 --> 00:11:36.520
where they are fed poisoned ingredients.

00:11:36.520 --> 00:11:38.620
At least they get to eat.

00:11:40.720 --> 00:11:45.360
On the next section of the menu, 
the fish course, there is no food.

00:11:45.930 --> 00:11:48.400
On the floor of the meat 
course, water is denied.

00:11:48.400 --> 00:11:50.600
And if the heinous criminals still survive,

00:11:50.930 --> 00:11:54.400
the next step is where 
their own flesh is cooked.

00:11:54.770 --> 00:11:57.600
Sliced, boiled, fried...

00:11:57.600 --> 00:12:02.940
Finally, they are thrown from Honey 
Prison, to surely meet their deaths.

00:12:03.340 --> 00:12:06.850
This is the Gourmet prison, Honey Prison.

00:12:09.280 --> 00:12:12.450
That's definitely one deadly Full Course.

00:12:12.450 --> 00:12:15.960
An eye for an eye... That's 
the era we live in.

00:12:15.960 --> 00:12:17.490
Now, come this way.

00:12:19.990 --> 00:12:23.560
My job is to prepare meals for people.

00:12:23.960 --> 00:12:27.770
All I ever think of is how 
to prepare delicious meals.

00:12:28.330 --> 00:12:33.170
But this place is the exact opposite. 
It's a place that takes food away.

00:12:33.440 --> 00:12:38.140
This is a darkness hiding behind the 
shining beacon of the Gourmet Age.

00:12:44.680 --> 00:12:46.220
We have arrived.

00:12:46.690 --> 00:12:48.490
This is the chief's room.

00:12:49.760 --> 00:12:50.990
It's huge!

00:12:51.990 --> 00:12:56.330
Is this chief a giant like Melk the first?

00:12:56.330 --> 00:12:59.130
Chief! I have brought them.

00:13:17.150 --> 00:13:21.390
Don't go comparing me to Melk the first!

00:13:21.720 --> 00:13:22.920
How rude!

00:13:25.190 --> 00:13:27.660
What?! A kid?!

00:13:27.660 --> 00:13:29.360
My name is Love!

00:13:29.690 --> 00:13:31.900
I'm the chief of Honey Prison.

00:13:31.900 --> 00:13:36.100
I'm not a kid! How rude of 
you! Take a good look at me!

00:13:36.100 --> 00:13:42.070
But any two ways you look, you sure seem 
like a little kid... Right, Toriko-san?

00:13:44.310 --> 00:13:47.310
W-What a beauty!

00:13:47.310 --> 00:13:49.450
Uh... What the...?

00:13:49.450 --> 00:13:50.280
Chief...

00:13:51.550 --> 00:13:55.150
Toriko-san, she's a beauty? 
I don't see exactly...

00:13:55.150 --> 00:13:59.060
Take a good look at Chief Love, Komatsu!

00:14:01.520 --> 00:14:06.130
So you must be Toriko-chan's 
partner, Komatsu-chan, yes?

00:14:10.870 --> 00:14:14.400
Welcome to Honey Prison.

00:14:14.670 --> 00:14:17.710
What a beauty!

00:14:21.040 --> 00:14:22.650
Simple, aren't you?

00:14:22.650 --> 00:14:23.680
However...

00:14:23.680 --> 00:14:25.680
Chief, I believe that's enough.

00:14:27.320 --> 00:14:31.690
But you guys aren't my type!

00:14:33.290 --> 00:14:35.190
What? Weren't you just...

00:14:35.190 --> 00:14:38.960
An illusion? No, that was no mere hypnosis...

00:14:38.960 --> 00:14:42.000
My senses were manipulated direct... 
Almost like they were ordered!

00:14:42.000 --> 00:14:45.370
Like they were instructed 
forcefully to love you!

00:14:46.970 --> 00:14:49.340
This... Could it be pheromones?

00:14:49.340 --> 00:14:53.070
Ah, not bad, Toriko-chan. None other.

00:14:53.070 --> 00:14:56.110
I can manipulate pheromones at will.

00:14:56.110 --> 00:14:57.480
Pheromones?

00:14:57.480 --> 00:15:00.850
They're excreted compounds which 
are produced in creatures' bodies

00:15:00.850 --> 00:15:05.150
and have effects on others' actions 
and psychological phenomena.

00:15:05.150 --> 00:15:08.260
I just shot you with sex pheromones.

00:15:08.260 --> 00:15:11.960
It is a type of pheromone used 
to attract the opposite sex.

00:15:13.030 --> 00:15:16.530
The chief has the ability to use many 
hundreds of different types of pheromones,

00:15:16.530 --> 00:15:20.330
so, like a Queen Bee, she 
orders the staff and Beasts,

00:15:20.330 --> 00:15:23.000
controlling all of Honey Prison.

00:15:23.000 --> 00:15:27.640
So this super strong prison itself 
is controlled by pheromones, then?

00:15:27.640 --> 00:15:33.010
It's said that pheromones are sensed in 
the vomeronasal organ in a human's nose.

00:15:33.450 --> 00:15:35.280
That's where the hypothalamus is.

00:15:35.280 --> 00:15:38.420
In other words, it transmits 
directly to the brain.

00:15:38.820 --> 00:15:41.620
There, no one in the world

00:15:41.620 --> 00:15:45.090
could defend against the 
odorless, tasteless pheromones!

00:15:45.090 --> 00:15:50.960
In other words, you can control any 
and all creatures exactly as you wish!

00:15:50.960 --> 00:15:53.030
But there's one that I can't!

00:15:53.530 --> 00:15:58.070
Just one person! He won't 
listen to what I say at all!

00:15:58.570 --> 00:16:01.170
And that person is... Don't tell me...

00:16:01.170 --> 00:16:02.980
It's Zebra-chan!

00:16:02.980 --> 00:16:07.410
He's just my type! Zebra-chan 
is like an arrow to my heart!

00:16:07.750 --> 00:16:10.780
The real reason the chief 
is against Zebra's release,

00:16:10.780 --> 00:16:16.150
is because she wishes her beloved 
Zebra to always be by her side.

00:16:17.420 --> 00:16:19.060
What kind of reason is that?

00:16:19.060 --> 00:16:23.130
What's wrong with an old lady 
like me falling in love, huh?!

00:16:23.130 --> 00:16:24.900
Wait, how old are you?

00:16:26.200 --> 00:16:30.670
I know, I know... It's an order from 
the President, so I guess I gotta...

00:16:30.670 --> 00:16:33.440
Zebra-chan committed serious crimes,

00:16:33.440 --> 00:16:38.540
but he also discovered even more 
ingredients than Toriko-chan!

00:16:38.540 --> 00:16:41.210
He's got some incredible accomplishments 
as a Gourmet Hunter.

00:16:41.210 --> 00:16:43.510
Well, most of them are 
off the record, though.

00:16:44.320 --> 00:16:50.290
Ore Armor Tusked Pig (Mammalian Beast) 
Capture Level 45 (B-rank Execution Beast)

00:16:46.920 --> 00:16:49.990
This is a B-rank Execution 
Beast, an Ore Armor Tusked Pig.

00:16:50.620 --> 00:16:52.520
Then, this is...

00:16:52.920 --> 00:16:54.320
Death row.

00:16:54.320 --> 00:16:57.890
This is the floor of the main dish 
for the Punishment Full Course.

00:16:57.890 --> 00:17:01.400
All the criminals who've received 
the ultimate punishment

00:17:01.400 --> 00:17:04.570
are sent directly to this 
Punishment Full Course floor.

00:17:04.570 --> 00:17:09.070
In other words, all the criminals 
here are sentenced to death.

00:17:09.510 --> 00:17:15.010
We also confine dangerous beasts 
and isolated creatures here.

00:17:15.280 --> 00:17:20.880
We were keeping an eye on a strange 
little bird-man creature a while ago.

00:17:21.080 --> 00:17:22.790
It was a fierce one.

00:17:22.790 --> 00:17:25.250
I suspect it was only a child, too.

00:17:25.590 --> 00:17:28.860
By the way... Zebra-chan 
is also on this floor!

00:17:29.890 --> 00:17:35.500
So, um... why is Zebra-san here exactly?

00:17:40.300 --> 00:17:42.970
He ate too much food.

00:17:43.870 --> 00:17:45.310
Ate too much?

00:17:45.310 --> 00:17:47.280
And for that, he got the death penalty?

00:17:47.280 --> 00:17:49.140
Yup. Now, this way.

00:17:49.340 --> 00:17:54.050
Problem child... So, his problem 
was that he eats too much?

00:17:54.280 --> 00:17:56.950
But then, why the death penalty?

00:17:59.120 --> 00:18:03.360
Is Zebra in some special solitary 
confinement or something?

00:18:03.360 --> 00:18:05.160
No, he's in a punishment ward.

00:18:05.160 --> 00:18:07.900
He's being punished?!

00:18:07.900 --> 00:18:13.700
Yes. Zebra has been undergoing 
punishment ever since he arrived here.

00:18:13.700 --> 00:18:17.840
Seriously? Don't tell me 
it was actually his idea...

00:18:17.840 --> 00:18:19.210
You understand well.

00:18:20.170 --> 00:18:24.410
Zebra-chan's nice and fit for punishment.

00:18:24.910 --> 00:18:27.650
Now then, here's Zebra-chan's room.

00:18:36.060 --> 00:18:37.260
Zebra!

00:18:38.060 --> 00:18:41.230
Zebra-chan, it's finally time for us to part!

00:18:41.230 --> 00:18:42.100
Chief...

00:18:42.100 --> 00:18:44.060
We came to get you!

00:18:44.060 --> 00:18:46.530
That's... Zebra-san.

00:18:48.600 --> 00:18:49.440
Hey, Zebra!

00:18:50.300 --> 00:18:54.670
Oh yeah... He's been silent 
ever since we got here.

00:18:54.670 --> 00:18:57.240
Don't tell me... He's been charging up?!

00:18:57.240 --> 00:18:58.010
Crap!

00:18:58.640 --> 00:19:02.880
Growsaurus (Mammalian Beast) Capture 
Level 57 (A-rank Execution Beast)

00:19:00.810 --> 00:19:03.780
The A-rank Execution Beast, 
Growsaurus, has started to move!

00:19:03.780 --> 00:19:05.990
The chains are going to 
be pulled... Stand back!

00:19:06.420 --> 00:19:07.350
What?!

00:19:07.350 --> 00:19:08.690
In this punishment room,

00:19:08.690 --> 00:19:13.560
chains connected to Execution Beasts 
are tied to his arms and legs!

00:19:14.260 --> 00:19:20.130
If the four Execution Beasts 
pull at once, he won't survive!

00:19:21.900 --> 00:19:22.800
Zebra!

00:19:28.010 --> 00:19:29.210
Love you!

00:19:30.240 --> 00:19:35.850
Looks like today's the last day 
I'll play around with you guys...

00:19:36.450 --> 00:19:38.020
See ya.

00:19:39.520 --> 00:19:42.250
This is bad. Hurry and 
cover your ears, Komatsu!

00:19:42.790 --> 00:19:44.420
Cover your ears and get down, now!

00:19:44.620 --> 00:19:48.630
Sound Bazooka!

00:19:49.460 --> 00:19:50.660
Here it comes!

00:19:58.940 --> 00:20:00.640
What the heck is this?!

00:20:17.120 --> 00:20:21.090
Hey Zebra! You tryin' to kill us, too?

00:20:22.490 --> 00:20:27.160
How about that, Toriko? Did 
I open your eyes a little?

00:20:27.160 --> 00:20:29.900
You look like you've gone soft!

00:20:30.830 --> 00:20:36.270
Looks like the world's pretty 
boring without me around.

00:21:39.370 --> 00:21:40.700
Dishing with Tina!

00:21:41.770 --> 00:21:44.640
It's "Dishing with Tina", the talk 
show with a heaping helping of fun!

00:21:44.640 --> 00:21:48.010
Today's guest is the Gourmet 
Reviver, Yosaku-san!

00:21:49.280 --> 00:21:52.150
Um, could you please refrain 
from smoking during recording?

00:21:52.150 --> 00:21:54.750
What? It's against the rules?

00:21:54.750 --> 00:21:57.180
Then I will break that rule!

00:21:58.320 --> 00:22:00.590
Well that's a heaping helping of trouble...

00:22:00.590 --> 00:22:04.360
Our super-revealing interview 
today will be a quiz,

00:22:04.360 --> 00:22:07.190
so if you fail the quiz, put down the cigar,

00:22:07.190 --> 00:22:11.130
and tell us about the most delicious 
experience you've had in your life.

00:22:11.130 --> 00:22:14.100
That's the rule!  I mean...

00:22:14.100 --> 00:22:15.800
...the promise!

00:22:15.800 --> 00:22:17.100
Fine.

00:22:17.100 --> 00:22:20.910
I break rules, but I'm a 
man who keeps promises.

00:22:20.910 --> 00:22:22.580
No kidding...

00:22:22.580 --> 00:22:25.110
Then first, it's "Guess the Capture Level"!

00:22:25.110 --> 00:22:26.880
The Capture Level of a Garara Gator?

00:22:26.880 --> 00:22:27.610
5.

00:22:27.610 --> 00:22:28.650
Troll Kong?

00:22:28.650 --> 00:22:29.550
9.

00:22:29.550 --> 00:22:31.350
Next is... um...

00:22:31.350 --> 00:22:34.450
Man, this is so easy I'm 
gonna die from laughter.

00:22:35.320 --> 00:22:39.860
Then I'm gonna ad-lib and give you 
a super-sized difficult question!

00:22:41.130 --> 00:22:45.200
Who is the person officially recognized 
as a Living Gourmet National Treasure,

00:22:45.200 --> 00:22:47.270
and former guest of this problem?

00:22:47.270 --> 00:22:49.600
Granny Setsu?! She's here?

00:22:49.600 --> 00:22:53.400
That's against the rules! 
Breaking the rules is no fair!

00:22:53.400 --> 00:22:59.240
Um... Setsuno-san was here quite 
a while ago. Are you listening?

00:23:03.080 --> 00:23:04.980
On to the next segment...

00:23:07.020 --> 00:23:09.120
A roaring, rumbling, rolling voice!

00:23:09.330 --> 00:23:10.590
We didn't plan for any of this!

00:23:10.850 --> 00:23:14.020
The last of the Four Kings causes a sensation!

00:23:14.400 --> 00:23:17.330
Unleashed Roar! Death Row Zebra's Release!

00:23:17.760 --> 00:23:19.410
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
